# Pins

Every pin with how and when it was last verified. Change a pin with the `pin-check` skill: read
the primary source{% if with_rust %}; product pin changes run the tests (`just hygiene` runs `just deps`){% endif %}, and date the row here.
A row without a date is not verified: rows carried from the template say so until checked here.

{% if with_rust -%}
## Rust

| Component | Pin | Verified | How |
|---|---|---|---|
| toolchain | {{ rust_toolchain }} (`rust-toolchain.toml`) | not yet (template) | `rustc --version` inside the repo |

Workspace dependencies are pinned exactly (`=x.y.z` or a git `rev`) and each needs a row here;
`just deps` enforces both. Declare crate families that must resolve to one version in
`[workspace.metadata.pins] families` in `Cargo.toml`.

